        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                "word": "abolitionnisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "51c7d421-96e9-44b9-8639-39ddc38c3796",
                        "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "abolitionnismes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7e6eb14-856e-3bbc-aa40-c153a6a91d0d",
                        "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée en faveur de l’abolition de l’esclavage, et donc en défaveur de sa légalisation encadrée ou non par une réglementation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Antiracisme",
                            "Esclavagisme"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "41e1b47a-f5af-480b-b004-ca1f5171a669",
                                "sense_id": "d7e6eb14-856e-3bbc-aa40-c153a6a91d0d",
                                "text": "Hasarder quelque pitié pour un nègre, n’était-ce point se rendre coupable d’abolitionnisme ? Autant dire : crime d’État ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cff210a9-032f-3d3e-b11d-52add417e318",
                        "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée en faveur de l’abolition de la prostitution, et donc en défaveur de sa légalisation encadrée ou non par une réglementation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "419e13c4-fb50-4480-a763-5879b15f2249",
                                "sense_id": "cff210a9-032f-3d3e-b11d-52add417e318",
                                "text": "Enfin, l’abolitionnisme quant à lui, se présente comme un système idéologique qui prend le contre-pied des positions réglementaristes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e6a8b85-4d5c-38c4-9fb7-1289bd2abed4",
                        "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée en faveur de l’abolition du système pénal, y compris la police, la justice pénale et les prisons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Justice",
                            "Prison"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "860c64aa-f141-4015-846e-f4be0aa3b921",
                                "sense_id": "6e6a8b85-4d5c-38c4-9fb7-1289bd2abed4",
                                "text": "D’une manière générale, l’intérêt de leurs réflexions est de dépasser la remarque fréquemment faite d’une « justice injuste ». De plus, les textes présentés montrent bien que la cible de l’abolitionnisme est le système pénal, et non pas la seule prison. Par ailleurs, ces auteurs et autrices évoquent abondamment la question des victimes alors que l’abolitionnisme pénal est souvent accusé de s’en désintéresser par les « légitimistes », c’est-à-dire les personnes qui, contre les abolitionnistes, défendent la légitimité de l’existence du système pénal, et par les critiques mal informés"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "34e310e2-40eb-30e1-a1d6-90ca8a321244",
                        "entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Courant de pensée qui défend l’abolition de toute forme d’exploitation des animaux par l’être humain."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Antispécisme"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62d7816d-0f2e-424d-b322-7abf1120f940",
                        "source_entry_id": "aaee1394-db42-3b8e-aee8-6e51a24a647d",
                        "target_lang_word": "abolitionism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "abolitionism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e13596d-c088-35da-ab1c-d8e1b84ae6ec",
                                        "entry_id": "8dde79c1-2e3f-365a-ba64-3347fe66b656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Support for the abolition of something; the tenets of abolitionists."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "810a3bf8-2bcf-4f41-8edc-321a0133ac77",
                                                "sense_id": "8e13596d-c088-35da-ab1c-d8e1b84ae6ec",
                                                "text": "Abolitionism is based on the moral conviction that social life should not and, in fact, cannot be regulated effectively by criminal law …. As a social movement committed to the abolition of the prison or even the entire penal system, abolitionism originated in campaigns for prisoners' rights and penal reform."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d191f0ac-aff3-4d43-ae3a-7ca5422a5752",
                                                "sense_id": "8e13596d-c088-35da-ab1c-d8e1b84ae6ec",
                                                "text": "Abolitionism is still a powerful philosophy among contemporary feminists, both in the West and in the developing world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dca3dbad-696e-3c46-85cb-8139c633b43d",
                                        "entry_id": "8dde79c1-2e3f-365a-ba64-3347fe66b656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Support for the abolition of something; the tenets of abolitionists.",
                                            "Support for the abolition of prisons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3337670-a5d9-46fd-982c-1ff660bb46f1",
                                                "sense_id": "dca3dbad-696e-3c46-85cb-8139c633b43d",
                                                "text": "ABOLITIONISM\nPrisons and jails have been condemned, at least by some, for as long as they have existed.[…] In the United States, the most profound statement of support for abolitionism is the document Instead of Prisons […] Abolitionism has also given emphasis to didferent strategies for change, ranging from simply abolishing prisons to abolishing the entire criminal justice apparatus, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "865e404c-0c63-373b-9e72-2e93782f1643",
                                        "entry_id": "8dde79c1-2e3f-365a-ba64-3347fe66b656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Support for the abolition of something; the tenets of abolitionists.",
                                            "Support for the abolition (banning) of sex work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "997b70c6-6cb0-4433-a58c-3de439345077",
                                                "sense_id": "865e404c-0c63-373b-9e72-2e93782f1643",
                                                "text": "Abolitionism is a term that refers to a particular ideological and legal approach to prostitution. The approach has its roots in 19th-century feminism and is still a potent force […] Thus abolitionism arose as a movement against the state regulation of prostitution. The leader of the abolitionist movement was Josephine Butler, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d18035c-8654-3dd0-bed6-da94c7baf155",
                                        "entry_id": "8dde79c1-2e3f-365a-ba64-3347fe66b656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Support for the abolition of something; the tenets of abolitionists.",
                                            "Support for the abolition (banning) of abortion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "436ed25a-0e0e-35eb-a929-9e2a3d9c7553",
                                        "entry_id": "8dde79c1-2e3f-365a-ba64-3347fe66b656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Support for the abolition of slavery."
                                        ],
